alphaj   = 0.1 * Plasma current profile index (⍺ⱼ)
alphan   = 0.9 * Plasma density profile index (⍺ₙ)
alphat   = 1.4 * Plasma temperature profile index (⍺ₜ)
aspect   = 1.8 * Plasma aspect ratio (A) (`iteration variable 1`)
