i_beta_component = 3 * switch for beta limit scaling (`constraint equation 24`)
i_plasma_current = 9 * switch for plasma current scaling to use
i_diamagnetic_current = 2 * switch for diamagnetic current scaling
i_density_limit = 7 * switch for density limit to enforce (`constraint equation 5`)
i_plasma_pedestal = 1 * switch for pedestal profiles;
i_pfirsch_schluter_current = 1 * switch for Pfirsch-Schlüter current scaling (issue #413);
radius_plasma_pedestal_density_norm = 0.95 * PPlasma normalised radius of density pedestal (ρₙ;pedestal)  (`i_plasma_pedestal==1`)
radius_plasma_pedestal_temp_norm = 0.925 * Plasma normalised radius of temperature pedestal (ρₜ;pedestal) (`i_plasma_pedestal==1`)
tbeta    = 2.0 * Plasma temperature profile index beta (βₜ)  (`i_plasma_pedestal==1)
temp_plasma_pedestal_electron_kev = 4.5 * Plasma electron temperature of pedestal (Tₑ;pedestal) [keV] (`i_plasma_pedestal==1`)
temp_plasma_separatrix_electron_kev = 0.125 * Plasma electron temperature at separatrix (Tₑ;ₛₑₚ) [keV] (`i_plasma_pedestal==1`) calculated if reinke
i_beta_norm_max = 0 * Switch for maximum normalised beta scaling (βₙ)
i_ind_plasma_internal_norm = 0 * Switch for plasma normalised internal inductance scaling (lᵢ)
i_alphaj = 0 * Switch for plasma current profile index scaling (αⱼ) 
i_plasma_geometry = 0 * switch for plasma elongation and triangularity calculations;
itart    = 1 * switch for spherical tokamak (ST) models;
itartpf  = 1 * switch for Spherical Tokamak PF models;
kappa    = 2.8 * Plasma separatrix elongation (κₐ)  (calculated if `i_plasma_geometry = 1-5; 7 or 9-10`)
q0       = 2.0 * Plasma safety factor on axis (q₀)
q95      = 5.91269208919734 * Plasma safety factor at 95% flux surface (q₉₅) (`iteration variable 18`)
f_nd_alpha_thermal_electron = 0.08733555732325313 * Thermal alpha density/electron density (⟨n_αₜₕ⟩/⟨nₑ⟩)
ind_plasma_internal_norm = 0.3 * Plasma normalised internal inductance
rmajor   = 4.5 * Plasma major radius (R₀) [m] (`iteration variable 3`)
i_single_null = 0 * switch for single null / double null plasma;
f_sync_reflect = 0.6 * synchrotron wall reflectivity factor
temp_plasma_electron_vol_avg_kev = 11.67051234603975 * Plasma volume averaged electron temperature (⟨Tₑ⟩) [keV] (`iteration variable 4`)
f_temp_plasma_ion_electron = 1.0 * Plasma ratio of ion temperature to electron temperature (used to calculate temp_plasma_ion_vol_avg_kev if `f_temp_plasma_ion_electron > 0;0`)
